{
 "file": "06BLK10I base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:23",
   "ptr": "0x23",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「薬師のパルマンさんが《黒い鉱石》に\\n",
   "en": "\"Palman-san the apothecary improved the Black Ore? If you don't mind, could I take a look?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:4c",
   "ptr": "0x4c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  改良を？  よかったら、ちょっと見せ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:23"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:75",
   "ptr": "0x75",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  てもらえませんか？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:23"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:8f",
   "ptr": "0x8f",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　・・・・・・\\n",
   "en": "...... ...Oh, this is... ...I see, of course, amazing!",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:a2",
   "ptr": "0xa2",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　・・・あ、これは。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　・・・・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:8f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:bb",
   "ptr": "0xbb",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　・・・そうかぁ、なるほど、すご～い！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　・・・あ、これは。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:8f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:e7",
   "ptr": "0xe7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　え？　あ、すみません、勝手に興奮し\\n",
   "en": "Huh? Oh, I'm sorry, I got carried away. But such an unexpected transmutation of elements... When it comes to poison, he really does wonderful work.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:110",
   "ptr": "0x110",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ちゃって。でも、こんな思いもよらな\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:e7"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:139",
   "ptr": "0x139",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  い元素転換を・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:e7"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:153",
   "ptr": "0x153",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  さすがに、毒のことでは素晴らしい\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:e7"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:17a",
   "ptr": "0x17a",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  仕事をする人ですね、あの方は」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:e7"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:1ac",
   "ptr": "0x1ac",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「どうだ？　防具を造れそうか？」\\f",
   "en": "\"Well? Can you make armor from it?\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:1de",
   "ptr": "0x1de",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「そうですね。ここまで原料が完成さ\\n",
   "en": "\"Let me see. With the material this far along, even we could probably make it, but...",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:205",
   "ptr": "0x205",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  れていたら、わたしたちでも造れる\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:1de"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:22c",
   "ptr": "0x22c",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  でしょうけど・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:1de"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:246",
   "ptr": "0x246",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　どうせなら、武具を専門に造ってる\\n",
   "en": "while you're at it, why not ask someone who makes arms for a living?",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:26d",
   "ptr": "0x26d",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  方に、依頼してみたらどうですか？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:246"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:295",
   "ptr": "0x295",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　今、街では評判の名人がいるそうです\\n",
   "en": "I hear the Master Smith everyone's talking about is in town now? We'd planned to ask that Master Smith to make it ourselves if we managed to improve the ore.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:2be",
   "ptr": "0x2be",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ね？  わたしたちも、鉱石の改良に成\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:295"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:2e7",
   "ptr": "0x2e7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  功したら、その名人に造っていただこ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:295"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:310",
   "ptr": "0x310",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  うと思ってたんです」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:295"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:33a",
   "ptr": "0x33a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「みなさんのおかげで、《黒い鉱石》の\\n",
   "en": "\"Thanks to all of you, we can finally see a way to improve the Black Ore.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:363",
   "ptr": "0x363",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  改良の目処（メド）が立ちました。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:33a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:38b",
   "ptr": "0x38b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　いずれは大量に生産して、市民の方々\\n",
   "en": "Someday I hope to mass-produce it and hand it out to the citizens too. Then nobody will need to fear the Black Dragon's Wave anymore!\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:3b4",
   "ptr": "0x3b4",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  にも配布しようと思います。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:38b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:3d5",
   "ptr": "0x3d5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  そうなれば、もう《黒竜》の波動は恐\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:38b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:3fe",
   "ptr": "0x3fe",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  くありません！」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:38b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:433",
   "ptr": "0x433",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「なに？　《黒い鉱石》を使って防具を\\n",
   "en": "\"What? Make armor using the Black Ore, you say? ...Here, let's have a look at it!",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:45c",
   "ptr": "0x45c",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  造れだと？\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:433"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:46d",
   "ptr": "0x46d",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・どれ、そいつを見せてみろ！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  造れだと？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:433"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:495",
   "ptr": "0x495",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　・・・・・・・・・\\n",
   "en": "......... Ho ho, so this is...",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:4ae",
   "ptr": "0x4ae",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　ほほう、これが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　・・・・・・・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:495"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:4ca",
   "ptr": "0x4ca",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　うむ・・・\\n",
   "en": "Hm... Hm hm! Hmmmmm.",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:4db",
   "ptr": "0x4db",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　うむうむ！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　うむ・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:4ca"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:4ec",
   "ptr": "0x4ec",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　う～～～む。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　うむうむ！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:4ca"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:500",
   "ptr": "0x500",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　面白い！　やってみようじゃないか！」\\f",
   "en": "Interesting! Let's give it a shot!\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:538",
   "ptr": "0x538",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「手数をかけて済まん・・・\\n",
   "en": "\"Sorry for the trouble... How much will it cost?\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:557",
   "ptr": "0x557",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　費用はどれくらいだ？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:538"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:581",
   "ptr": "0x581",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「そうだな、今回に限って金はいらん。\\n",
   "en": "\"Let's see. Just this once, I won't take money. But you two will be doing an experiment for me.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:5aa",
   "ptr": "0x5aa",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ただし、お前らには実験をやってもら\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:581"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:5d3",
   "ptr": "0x5d3",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  うぞ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:581"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:5ed",
   "ptr": "0x5ed",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "「実験？」\\f",
   "en": "\"An experiment?\"",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:609",
   "ptr": "0x609",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「これから造る防具が、本当に《黒竜》\\n",
   "en": "\"Whether the armor I'm about to make can really block the Black Dragon's Wave...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:632",
   "ptr": "0x632",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  の波動を防げるかどうか・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:609"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:655",
   "ptr": "0x655",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  その実験だ。文句はないな？」",
   "en": "that's the experiment. No complaints, right?\"",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:685",
   "ptr": "0x685",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "「どうだ？\\n",
   "en": "\"Well?",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:694",
   "ptr": "0x694",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　新しい防具の実験台になるか？」",
   "en": "Will you be the guinea pigs for the new armor?\"",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:6de",
   "ptr": "0x6de",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「よし、いい覚悟だ・・・\\f",
   "en": "\"Good, that's the spirit...",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:6fc",
   "ptr": "0x6fc",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　防具が出来しだい、城に行くぞ！\\n",
   "en": "Soon as the armor's done, we're off to the castle! I'll see for myself how well it works.\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:721",
   "ptr": "0x721",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　効果の程を確かめさせてもらおう」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:6fc"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:768",
   "ptr": "0x768",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「まあ、失敗したら波動を浴びて死ぬわ\\n",
   "en": "\"Well, if it fails, you get hit by the Wave and die, so I won't force you.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:791",
   "ptr": "0x791",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  けだし、わしも無理にとは言わんよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK10I:768"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK10I:7bb",
   "ptr": "0x7bb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　自信はあるが、人間のやることに完全\\n",
   "en": "I'm confident, but nothing a man makes is ever perfect.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
